# Studio S3→S4 设计链 — REST Client 手工驱动
#
# 前置：S2 已完成（02 + AnalysisCompleted）
#   node scripts/lib/jnpf-auth.mjs --json && pnpm sync:http-env
#
# 流程：confirm S2 → stage confirm(需求) → 等 architect → stage confirm(架构) → 等三设计 Skill
# 断言：E2E_PIPELINE_ID=<id> pnpm test:api（Vitest，~10s）

@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@token = {{token}}
@pipelineId = {{pipelineId}}

### 0. 设计编排状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/studio/skills/design/{{pipelineId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1. S2 用户确认（物化 + HITL）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/studio/skills/analyst/{{pipelineId}}/confirm-requirement-spec
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "autoRunDesign": false
}

### 2. 需求阶段确认 → 触发 architect-skill
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/studio/pipeline/execute/stage/{{pipelineId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": true,
  "comment": "REST Client — 进入架构设计"
}

### 3. 轮询 architect 状态（完成后 Vitest 断言 03）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/studio/skills/{{pipelineId}}/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 架构阶段确认 → 触发 db / ui / system-design
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/studio/pipeline/execute/stage/{{pipelineId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": true,
  "comment": "REST Client — 进入详细设计"
}

### 5. 交付物列表（应有 03~06）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/studio/pipeline/execute/{{pipelineId}}/deliverables
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 补建 03（IR 已有但落盘失败时）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/studio/pipeline/execute/{{pipelineId}}/deliverables/rebuild?stages=S3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
